==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2025–26 Scottish Premiership}}
The Premiership fixture list was announced on 20 June 2025.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://spfl.co.uk/news/spfl-fixtures-for-202526 | title=SPFL fixtures for 2025/26 | publisher=SPFL | date=20 June 2025 | access-date=20 June 2025 | archive-date=6 July 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250706194338/https://spfl.co.uk/news/spfl-fixtures-for-202526 | url-status=live }}</ref> Celtic began their title defence against St Mirren at Celtic Park.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/june/20/celtic-begin-title-defence-at-home-against-st-mirren/ | title=Celtic begin title defence at home against St Mirren | publisher=Celtic FC | date=20 June 2025 | access-date=20 June 2025 | archive-date=21 June 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250621082501/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/june/20/celtic-begin-title-defence-at-home-against-st-mirren/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

