==Scottish League Cup==
{{Main|2025–26 Scottish League Cup}}
On 27 July, Celtic were drawn against [[Falkirk F.C.|Falkirk]] in the second round of the [[2025–26 Scottish League Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/july/27/celtic-face-home-tie-against-falkirk-in-league-cup-last-16/ | title=Celtic face home tie against Falkirk in League Cup last 16 | publisher=Celtic FC | date=27 July 2025 | access-date=27 July 2025 | archive-date=29 July 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250729162833/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/july/27/celtic-face-home-tie-against-falkirk-in-league-cup-last-16/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 16 August, Celtic were drawn against [[Partick Thistle F.C.|Partick Thistle]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/16/celtic-face-away-tie-against-partick-thistle-in-premier-sports-cup/ | title=Celtic face away tie against Partick Thistle in Premier Sports Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=16 August 2025 | access-date=16 August 2025 | archive-date=10 September 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250910163327/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/16/celtic-face-away-tie-against-partick-thistle-in-premier-sports-cup/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 21 September, Celtic were drawn against [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/september/21/celtic-face-cup-semi-final-clash-with-rangers-at-hampden/ | title=Celtic face cup semi-final clash with Rangers at Hampden | publisher=Celtic FC | date=21 September 2025 | access-date=21 September 2025}}</ref> Celtic faced [[St Mirren F.C.|St Mirren]] in the final on 14 December.

