==UEFA Champions League==
{{Main|2025–26 UEFA Champions League}}

===Play-off round===
{{main|2025–26 UEFA Champions League qualifying phase and play-off round#Play-off round}}
On 4 August, Celtic were drawn against the winners of the third qualifying round tie between [[FC Kairat|Kairat]] and [[ŠK Slovan Bratislava|Slovan Bratislava]], in the UEFA Champions League play-off round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/04/celtic-to-face-xxxxx-in-ucl-play/ | title=Celtic to face FC Kairat or Slovan Bratislava in UCL play-off round | publisher=Celtic FC | date=4 August 2025 | access-date=4 August 2025 | archive-date=5 August 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250805130922/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/04/celtic-to-face-xxxxx-in-ucl-play/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 12 August, it was determined that Celtic would face Kairat.

