==UEFA Europa League==
{{Main|2025–26 UEFA Europa League}}
Celtic entered the UEFA Europa League at the [[2025–26 UEFA Europa League league phase|league phase]].

===League phase===
{{main|2025–26 UEFA Europa League#League phase}}
On 29 August, the draw for the league phase was made. Celtic were drawn with [[AS Roma|Roma]] and [[Feyenoord]] (Pot 1), [[S.C. Braga|Braga]] and [[Red Star Belgrade]] (Pot 2), [[SK Sturm Graz|Sturm Graz]] and [[FC Midtjylland|Midtjylland]] (Pot 3), and [[FC Utrecht|Utrecht]] and [[Bologna FC 1909|Bologna]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/29/celtic-s-2024-25-uefa-europa-league-draw/ | title=Celtic's 2025/26 UEFA Europa League draw | publisher=Celtic FC | date=29 August 2025 | access-date=29 August 2025 | archive-date=29 August 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250829163413/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/august/29/celtic-s-2024-25-uefa-europa-league-draw/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

