===Knockout phase play-offs===
{{main|2025–26 UEFA Europa League knockout phase#Knockout phase play-offs}}
The draw for the knockout phase play-offs was held on 30 January 2026. Celtic were drawn against [[VfB Stuttgart]], as a result of finishing the league phase in 21st place.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/january/30/celts-to-meet-vfb-stuttgart-in-europa-play-offs/ | title=Celtic face VfB Stuttgart in Europa League play-off round | publisher=Celtic FC | date=30 January 2026 | access-date=30 January 2026 | archive-date=31 January 2026 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260131185137/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/january/30/celts-to-meet-vfb-stuttgart-in-europa-play-offs/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

