===Kit===
'''Supplier:''' [[Adidas]] / '''Sponsors:''' [[Dafabet]]

The club is in the first year of a new deal with [[Adidas]] – the club's official kit supplier since 2020.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/17678 | title=Celtic announce magnificent new five-year partnership with adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 March 2020 | access-date=25 May 2020 | archive-date=2 December 2020 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201202221352/https://www.celticfc.com/news/17678/ | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18279 | title=Celtic welcomes adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 July 2020 | access-date=1 July 2020 | archive-date=2 December 2020 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201202221347/https://www.celticfc.com/news/18279/ | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/may/01/celtic-and-adidas-agree-long-term-partnership-extension/ | title=Celtic and adidas agree long-term partnership extension | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 May 2025 | access-date=26 May 2025 | archive-date=17 June 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250617220547/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/may/01/celtic-and-adidas-agree-long-term-partnership-extension/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

