*'''Home:''' The home kit features a [[tartan]] pattern within the traditional green and white hoops, and a dark green trim. White shorts and socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/may/02/the-adidas-x-celtic-fc-2025-26-home-kit-is-revealed-today/ | title=The adidas x Celtic FC 2025/26 Home Kit is revealed today | publisher=Celtic FC | date=2 May 2025 | access-date=26 May 2025 | archive-date=3 May 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250503015038/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/may/02/the-adidas-x-celtic-fc-2025-26-home-kit-is-revealed-today/ | url-status=live }}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a black shirt with a neon green trim and horizontal pinstripes. The shirt is accompanied by black shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/july/15/pre-order-the-new-celtic-fc-x-adidas-away-kit-now/ | title=Pre-order the new Celtic FC x adidas Away Kit now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=15 July 2025 | access-date=15 July 2025 | archive-date=26 July 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250726155351/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/july/15/pre-order-the-new-celtic-fc-x-adidas-away-kit-now/ | url-status=live }}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features an off white shirt with an orange trim, pale green hoops and an embroidered four-leaf clover. The shirt is accompanied by pale green shorts and matching socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/june/27/celtic-fc-x-adidas-reveal-the-2025-26-third-kit--on-sale-now/ | title=Celtic FC x adidas reveal the 2025/26 Third Kit: on sale now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=27 June 2025 | access-date=27 June 2025 | archive-date=27 June 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250627130339/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/june/27/celtic-fc-x-adidas-reveal-the-2025-26-third-kit--on-sale-now/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

